#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:5
#: eccce985633c40b7b3977a4a45d58548
msgid "Rover: Adding a New Drive Mode"
msgstr "Rover：添加新的驾驶模式"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:7
#: 284f5f5a119d47fdbe472e40f4e798d8
msgid ""
"This page covers the basics of how to create a new driving (i.e. the "
"equivalent of Manual, Steering, etc).  A real example of adding a new flight"
" mode can be found in `this commit "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/commit/04e9228fa073c10ebe6f6f1f83f9d3c29a974315>`__"
" that first added the ACRO mode."
msgstr ""
"本页介绍如何创建新驾驶模式（即 Manual、Steering 等的等价物）的基础知识。添加新飞行模式的实际示例可参见首次添加 ACRO 模式的 "
"`此提交 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/commit/04e9228fa073c10ebe6f6f1f83f9d3c29a974315>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:9
#: b7d8e9f3a77d4b86b21b340e0d84fc90
msgid ""
"As a reference the diagram below provides a high level view of Rover's "
"architecture."
msgstr "以下架构图提供了 Rover 的高层视图供参考。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:14
#: 6523b881d1774b98be5e18abda037692
msgid ""
"Pick a name for the new mode (i.e. \"NEW_MODE\") and add it to the mode enum"
" in `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h#L21>`__ as "
"\"NEW_MODE\" has been added below."
msgstr ""
"为新模式选择一个名称（如「NEW_MODE」），并将其添加到 `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ardupilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h#L21>`__ "
"中的模式枚举，如下方添加「NEW_MODE」所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:32
#: 7ff6918576af46fbb6b0a0cb82f2dc66
msgid ""
"Define a new class for the mode in `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h>`__. It is "
"probably easiest to copy a similar existing mode's class definition and just"
" change the class name (i.e. copy and rename \"class ModeAcro\" to \"class "
"ModeNewMode\"). The new class must implement the ``mode_number()``, "
"``name4()`` and ``update()`` methods."
msgstr ""
"在 `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h>`__ "
"中为该模式定义新类。最简单的方式是复制一个相似的现有模式的类定义，然后只修改类名（例如将「class ModeAcro」复制并重命名为「class "
"ModeNewMode」）。新类必须实现 ``mode_number()``、``name4()`` 和 ``update()`` 方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:43
#: 49b7430854b44f7a8dc7f8e3b6777cf4
msgid ""
"You may also want to implement the protected ``_enter()`` method to perform "
"any initialisation required as the vehicle enters the mode (i.e. init "
"position controllers as the user commands the vehicle to switch into the new"
" mode) or ``_exit()`` to perform any cleanup as the vehicle leaves the mode:"
msgstr ""
"您还可以实现 protected 方法 "
"``_enter()``，在飞行器进入该模式时执行必要的初始化（例如，当用户命令飞行器切换到新模式时初始化位置控制器），或实现 ``_exit()`` "
"在飞行器离开该模式时进行清理："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:52
#: 5bc0343c2cf848f89687fe038bfd6dfe
msgid ""
"Finally there are some simple methods returning true/false that you may want"
" to override that control features such as whether the vehicle can be armed "
"in the new mode:"
msgstr "最后，还有一些返回 true/false 的简单方法可供重写，用于控制飞行器在新模式下是否可解锁等功能特性："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:65
#: de2b9a38d9b34ab5aafc85f7de3bcbd6
msgid ""
"Create a new mode_<new flight mode>.cpp file based on a similar mode such as"
" `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"or `mode_steering.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_steering.cpp>`__."
" This new file should implement the ``update()`` method which will be called"
" 50 times per second.  This function's main responsibility is to decode the "
"user's input, create new heading and steering targets and then call the "
"steering and throttle controllers."
msgstr ""
"参考类似模式（如 `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"或 `mode_steering.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_steering.cpp>`__）创建新的"
" mode_<新飞行模式>.cpp 文件。该文件需实现每秒调用 50 次的 ``update()`` "
"方法，其主要职责是解析用户输入、生成新的航向和转向目标，然后调用转向控制器和油门控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:71
#: 53b06841fc2a4e57834a83e00a37cd5e
msgid ""
"Below is an excerpt from `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"that demonstrates how the pilot's input is converted into target speed (in "
"meters/second) and a target turn rate."
msgstr ""
"以下是 `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"的代码片段，演示如何将飞手输入转换为目标速度（米/秒）和目标转弯速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:85
#: 2420cc27b0a541a0b2ba27d679c24273
msgid ""
"Near the bottom of `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"you will see how these targets are sent to the steering and throttle "
"controllers. The steering and throttle controller interfaces can be found in"
" the `APM_Control/AR_AttitudeControl library "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/APM_Control/AR_AttitudeControl.h>`__."
"  The parent Mode class also provides some navigation methods that are "
"defined in `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h#L69>`__ "
"(search for \"navigation methods\")."
msgstr ""
"在 `mode_acro.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode_acro.cpp>`__ "
"底部附近，您可以看到这些目标如何发送到转向和油门控制器。转向和油门控制器的接口可在 `APM_Control/AR_AttitudeControl 库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/APM_Control/AR_AttitudeControl.h>`__"
" 中找到。父类 Mode 还提供了一些定义在 `mode.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.h#L69>`__ "
"中的导航方法（搜索「navigation methods」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:95
#: 4d9f9c66a1b646b2ae6de6b60b4bdb5a
msgid ""
"Instantiate the new mode class in `Rover.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/Rover.h#L382>`__ "
"by searching for \"ModeAcro\" and then adding the new mode somewhere below."
msgstr ""
"在 `Rover.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/Rover.h#L382>`__ "
"中搜索「ModeAcro」，然后在其下方添加新模式类的实例化。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:108
#: 060ee9ac633c4a1e9234311494ace2c1
msgid ""
"Also at the top of Rover.h add the new mode as a \"friend\" which allows the"
" mode to access the Rover class's internal variables and functions."
msgstr "同时在 Rover.h 顶部将新模式添加为「friend」，以允许该模式访问 Rover 类的内部变量和函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:124
#: 3f3a8d8168f04b3e9c42c99bbefa9791
msgid ""
"In `mode.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.cpp>`__ add "
"the new mode to the ``mode_from_mode_num()`` function to create the mapping "
"between the mode's number and the instance of the class."
msgstr ""
"在 `mode.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/mode.cpp>`__ "
"中，将新模式添加到 ``mode_from_mode_num()`` 函数中，建立模式编号与类实例之间的映射。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:142
#: 1e084fc3931e4a34a3b7dfdadbfd864b
msgid ""
"Add the new flight mode to the list of valid ``@Values`` for the ``MODE1 ~ "
"MODE6`` parameters in `Parameters.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/Parameters.cpp#L242>`__"
" (Search for \"MODE1\").  Once committed to master, this will cause the new "
"mode to appear in the ground stations list of valid modes.  Note that even "
"before being committed to master, a user can setup the new flight mode to be"
" activated from the transmitter's flight mode switch by directly setting the"
" MODE1 (or MODE2, etc) parameters to the number of the new mode."
msgstr ""
"在 `Parameters.cpp "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/Parameters.cpp#L242>`__"
" 中（搜索「MODE1」），将新飞行模式添加到 ``MODE1 ~ MODE6`` 参数的有效 ``@Values`` 列表。一旦提交到 master "
"分支，新模式将出现在地面站的有效模式列表中。注意，即使在提交到 master 之前，用户也可以通过直接将 MODE1（或 MODE2 "
"等）参数设置为新模式的编号，从遥控器的飞行模式开关激活新模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:160
#: 69dabe7ee45f4fa5a204bcf31251714c
msgid "**As a side note, Rover has 3 high level controllers:**"
msgstr "**附注，Rover 有 3 个高层控制器：**"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:165
#: 96a3cbda2c6847588554f0fccd72da1b
msgid ""
"the L1 controller converts an origin and destination (each expressed as a "
"latitude, longitude) into a lateral acceleration to make the vehicle travel "
"along the path from the origin to the destination.  This lateral "
"acceleration is then passed into the steering controller."
msgstr "L1 控制器将起点和目标点（各以经纬度表示）转换为横向加速度，使飞行器沿从起点到目标点的路径行驶。该横向加速度随后传入转向控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:166
#: f6bcafec68404a4da700350b24cdf876
msgid ""
"the steering controller can convert a desired lateral acceleration, a angle "
"error or a desired turn rate into a steering output command (expressed as a "
"number in the range -4500 to +4500) that should be fed into the motor "
"library (see `AR_MotorsUGV.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/AP_MotorsUGV.h>`__)"
msgstr ""
"转向控制器可将期望横向加速度、角度误差或期望转弯速率转换为转向输出命令（以 -4500 到 +4500 范围内的数值表示），输入到电机库（参见 "
"`AR_MotorsUGV.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/AP_MotorsUGV.h>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-adding-a-new-drive-mode.rst:167
#: 80e0c14eb9cd467f8bf621a1d781a598
msgid ""
"the throttle controller can convert a desired speed into a throttle command "
"(expressed as a number from -100 to +100) that should be fed into the motor "
"library (see `AR_MotorsUGV.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/AP_MotorsUGV.h>`__)"
msgstr ""
"油门控制器可将期望速度转换为油门命令（以 -100 到 +100 的数值表示），输入到电机库（参见 `AR_MotorsUGV.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/Rover/AP_MotorsUGV.h>`__）"
